    "detailed_description": "American Christmas is the story of a 12-year-old girl named &quot;Kate&quot; who is sent on a mission by an elf named &quot;Tip&quot;, to go save a kidnapped Santa Clause. The gameplay consists of the Main Campaign which has an overworld map, 13 levels, a Petshop, and an Arcade; And Nightmare mode, which is a never-ending survival mode specifically made for hardcore gamers who want to put their 2D platforming skills to the ultimate test.",
    "about_the_game": "American Christmas is the story of a 12-year-old girl named &quot;Kate&quot; who is sent on a mission by an elf named &quot;Tip&quot;, to go save a kidnapped Santa Clause. The gameplay consists of the Main Campaign which has an overworld map, 13 levels, a Petshop, and an Arcade; And Nightmare mode, which is a never-ending survival mode specifically made for hardcore gamers who want to put their 2D platforming skills to the ultimate test.",
    "short_description": "American Christmas is a Mario-Megaman-Sonic inspired 2D platformer. This game aims to recapture that magic feeling you\u2019d get when gaming during a time in the 90's when 2D platformers reigned king in the gaming industry.",
